          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='10205' id='340' type-v2='text' w='83920' x='16080' y='89795'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#17324d' fontsize='11'>CUSTOMER READOUT</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#5d6b78' fontsize='10'>Repeat customers represent 61.7% of purchasers but generate ~81% of sales and profit. Lifetime repeat appears much lower for newer customers mainly because they have had less time to return; when compared over the same 90-day window, repeat rates remain around 6–7%.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
